WEBVTT

00:00:00.114 --> 00:00:05.954
Open a part's settings: Text comes first. Type the words that belong to this part.

00:00:05.954 --> 00:00:18.125
Design plays every text design with your own words. Choose one for this part.

00:00:18.125 --> 00:00:30.903
Play the part: its words arrive, stay and leave in the chosen design.
